1
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:23,460
Sai Jinyin,

2
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,920
a woman in the con business like you,

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,850
why would you sell your own daughter?

4
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,510
Sir,

5
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:33,160
what are you talking about?

6
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:34,800
Kids

7
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:36,640
don't come cheap.

8
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:38,740
Food and daily necessities—

9
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,510
every single thing costs money.

10
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,040
She is...

11
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:43,960
She's your own flesh and blood.

12
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,380
Of course, she is.

13
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:48,620
Sir,

14
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,790
just look at the two of us.

15
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:53,150
These eyes, these eyebrows,
and this little nose.

16
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:54,700
This little girl

17
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:57,270
is the spitting image of me.

18
00:00:58,270 --> 00:01:00,230
Look how young she is.

19
00:01:00,590 --> 00:01:01,590
She's perfect.

20
00:01:03,270 --> 00:01:03,990
You smudged it again.

21
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:04,650
Hold still.

22
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:08,590
You little brat, stop right there!

23
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:11,950
Stop!

24
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:15,630
I said stop!

25
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:27,230
Why won't you listen?

26
00:01:27,950 --> 00:01:29,539
I asked why you wouldn't listen!

27
00:01:29,539 --> 00:01:30,710
Why won't you listen?

28
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:32,539
Is this how it's going to be every day?

29
00:01:32,539 --> 00:01:33,900
Is it?

30
00:01:34,990 --> 00:01:36,350
I told you to listen!

31
00:01:59,020 --> 00:01:59,950
Run!

32
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:02,020
Let's see you run now!

33
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:04,180
Let's see where you can run to!

34
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:05,540
I'll break your legs!

35
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:30,850
[A Prophet]

36
00:04:31,540 --> 00:04:33,860
[Episode 16]

37
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:49,070
I left the mortal world
to practice physiognomy.

38
00:04:49,070 --> 00:04:51,430
I left the mortal world
to practice physiognomy.

39
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:53,340
Everything in the mortal world
is already in the past.

40
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:55,700
Everything in the mortal world
is already in the past.

41
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:57,750
Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,
but the wind cannot be driven away.

42
00:04:57,750 --> 00:04:59,990
Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,
but the wind cannot be driven away.

43
00:04:59,990 --> 00:05:02,510
Life after life,
I belong to the physiognomy sect.

44
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:05,310
Life after life,
I belong to the physiognomy sect.

45
00:05:07,110 --> 00:05:08,710
Once you light this incense,

46
00:05:08,750 --> 00:05:11,670
you are members of the Tianxiang Sect.

47
00:05:12,020 --> 00:05:13,380
Now that you've entered the sect,

48
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:15,070
I have a word for you.

49
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:18,020
Every single one of us in Yuehaitang

50
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:19,580
is

51
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:22,070
a capable woman outside.

52
00:05:22,220 --> 00:05:23,990
We owe all our blessings today

53
00:05:24,110 --> 00:05:25,990
to the grandmaster.

54
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:28,630
-Thank you, Grandmaster.
-Thank you, Grandmaster.

55
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:30,560
Why do you join the Tianxiang Sect?

56
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:32,190
I couldn't bear a child

57
00:05:32,310 --> 00:05:33,710
for my husband's family.

58
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:35,990
So my husband threw me out.

59
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:37,550
My own family despised my poverty

60
00:05:37,550 --> 00:05:39,080
and refused to take me back.

61
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:41,480
I truly had nowhere else to go.

62
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:42,700
Senior,

63
00:05:42,900 --> 00:05:43,900
let her follow me.

64
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:52,380
My parents passed away when I was young,

65
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:53,940
and my relatives weren't wealthy.

66
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:55,740
I wanted to find work in the city,

67
00:05:56,820 --> 00:05:58,150
but no one would take me.

68
00:05:58,290 --> 00:05:59,920
It wasn't until I came
to the Tianxiang Sect

69
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,510
that I finally had a full meal.

70
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:03,110
I just wanted a bite to eat.

71
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,570
If you're asked

72
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:08,310
to kill someone for a full meal,

73
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,340
will you do it?

74
00:06:15,820 --> 00:06:16,820
Follow me.

75
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:19,020
As long as you are obedient,

76
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:21,150
I won't make things difficult for you.

77
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:25,320
What about you?

78
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:26,430
I...

79
00:06:27,110 --> 00:06:28,630
I didn't want to study,

80
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:30,700
so I ran away from home.

81
00:06:30,900 --> 00:06:33,070
If you can't even bear
the hardship of studying,

82
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:34,020
this place isn't for you.

83
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:34,630
Leave now.

84
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:40,020
Wait.

85
00:06:44,110 --> 00:06:46,040
They are the Sect Master's people?

86
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,430
Senior,

87
00:06:49,580 --> 00:06:51,750
I've checked the girls' backgrounds.

88
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:52,880
There are no issues.

89
00:06:53,020 --> 00:06:54,700
Sect Master gave special instructions.

90
00:06:54,700 --> 00:06:56,140
The girls are still useful.

91
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:57,740
They must stay at the branch.

92
00:06:57,870 --> 00:06:58,630
Then...

93
00:06:58,990 --> 00:06:59,990
let them all stay.

94
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:02,190
A state has its laws,

95
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:03,770
and a family has its rules.

96
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:04,900
From now on,

97
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:06,320
the Tianxiang Sect

98
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:08,460
is your home now.

99
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:11,340
This is a reward from the grandmaster.

100
00:07:11,340 --> 00:07:14,270
-Thank you, Grandmaster.
-Thank you, Grandmaster.

101
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:47,960
Are you asking about your love life, Miss?

102
00:07:48,220 --> 00:07:50,020
Who looks for romance nowadays?

103
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:52,190
I'm here for my financial fortune.

104
00:07:54,670 --> 00:07:55,820
You are destined

105
00:07:55,820 --> 00:07:57,070
for great wealth.

106
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:59,110
As the saying goes, heaven is vigorous.

107
00:07:59,110 --> 00:08:01,940
You just need to strive
constantly and work hard.

108
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:03,070
By autumn,

109
00:08:03,070 --> 00:08:04,550
a great fortune will fall from the sky.

110
00:08:04,550 --> 00:08:05,700
Autumn?

111
00:08:05,700 --> 00:08:06,900
I can't wait that long.

112
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:08,310
Just give me a straight answer.

113
00:08:08,310 --> 00:08:10,140
I'm going to the casino tonight.

114
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,690
Any chance of winning?

115
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:15,200
Miss, your birth element is Wood.

116
00:08:16,030 --> 00:08:18,070
You have Indirect Wealth in your chart.

117
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:20,110
You only need a man of the Water element

118
00:08:20,110 --> 00:08:23,110
to stir the energy,
and wealth will follow naturally.

119
00:08:24,820 --> 00:08:27,220
What does a Water-element man look like?

120
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:30,070
Tender or slightly tipsy?

121
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:33,179
Is he like the guy behind you?

122
00:08:40,270 --> 00:08:41,390
Do you know how many people

123
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:43,220
envy you for having such a father?

124
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:44,420
Look here, look here!

125
00:08:45,270 --> 00:08:46,500
Wang Jiaxian!

126
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,500
Why are you here?

127
00:08:50,430 --> 00:08:51,070
Jiaxian,

128
00:08:51,620 --> 00:08:52,740
why are you here?

129
00:08:52,820 --> 00:08:53,730
The last time I saw you

130
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:55,060
was at your wedding.

131
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,720
That girl was so nice.

132
00:08:57,220 --> 00:08:58,430
This place is boring.

133
00:08:58,430 --> 00:08:59,580
Let's go somewhere else.

134
00:08:59,580 --> 00:09:02,150
I want to have a drink with this girl.

135
00:09:13,430 --> 00:09:15,750
Why did you bring me here?

136
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:17,580
I was going to ask you the same thing.

137
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:18,910
Why are you here?

138
00:09:18,940 --> 00:09:21,030
I'm here to meet the mob.

139
00:09:21,050 --> 00:09:22,840
I just met a boss upstairs.

140
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:25,550
He is...

141
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:27,950
the Master Swindler.

142
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:37,340
Why were you looking for him?

143
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:38,540
I want to take down...

144
00:09:39,270 --> 00:09:41,140
that jerk producer, Tang Yushan.

145
00:09:41,260 --> 00:09:43,020
I want to avenge Manzhi.

146
00:09:43,980 --> 00:09:45,790
Poor Manzhi.

147
00:09:46,550 --> 00:09:47,580
You know what?

148
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,340
Tell me about it first.

149
00:09:49,340 --> 00:09:51,500
What did this guy do to you?

150
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:53,430
He ruined Ms. He's reputation.

151
00:09:53,580 --> 00:09:56,340
Ms. He died for no reason.

152
00:09:56,500 --> 00:09:58,270
It must be that guy Tang.

153
00:09:58,310 --> 00:09:59,910
Did the police investigate?

154
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,270
They did.

155
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:03,610
Suicide or homicide?

156
00:10:05,950 --> 00:10:06,700
Suicide.

157
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:07,790
He agreed?

158
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,670
He asked me for 100 gold bars.

159
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:11,500
Do I look like a gold bar to you?

160
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:14,230
100 gold bars for a life.

161
00:10:14,250 --> 00:10:15,440
No.

162
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:17,580
I don't want his life.

163
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:19,070
But I want him to apologize.

164
00:10:19,070 --> 00:10:19,950
I want him to kneel.

165
00:10:19,950 --> 00:10:20,620
I want him to repent.

166
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,070
I want to stop him
from publishing that book.

167
00:10:22,070 --> 00:10:23,340
Ms. He is already gone.

168
00:10:23,340 --> 00:10:24,940
He wants to publish a book now.

169
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:26,370
He wants to spread rumors about Ms. He.

170
00:10:26,370 --> 00:10:28,300
He wants to make money off the dead!

171
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,950
He's an animal.

172
00:10:33,100 --> 00:10:33,950
Deal.

173
00:10:34,270 --> 00:10:35,600
I'll help you with this.

174
00:10:35,950 --> 00:10:36,790
For free.

175
00:10:38,190 --> 00:10:39,190
Really?

176
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:40,820
By the way,

177
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:42,430
what do you do now?

178
00:10:43,070 --> 00:10:43,910
I'll tell you

179
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:45,340
everything later.

180
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:47,790
But you have to promise
me one thing first.

181
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:49,100
As long as you can help me,

182
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:50,580
I'll do anything.

183
00:10:51,070 --> 00:10:52,270
Words can't express my gratitude.

184
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:52,860
Jiaxian.

185
00:10:53,740 --> 00:10:54,910
Just one thing.

186
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:56,460
From now on,

187
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:58,670
don't call me Wang Jiaxian anymore.

188
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:01,430
Remember,

189
00:11:01,630 --> 00:11:03,290
call me Shangguan Chengming.

190
00:11:03,430 --> 00:11:05,190
And we've never met before.

191
00:11:05,580 --> 00:11:06,220
Got it?

192
00:11:06,430 --> 00:11:07,100
Shang...

193
00:11:08,150 --> 00:11:09,550
You changed your name?

194
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,750
Why?

195
00:11:10,780 --> 00:11:12,780
So we can get this done for free.

196
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:15,560
And so you don't mess with that mob boss.

197
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,600
It's easier to invite trouble
than to get rid of it,

198
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,570
you know?

199
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:23,500
Alright,

200
00:11:23,530 --> 00:11:24,770
then it's settled.

201
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:26,670
Is it?

202
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:29,540
The mob is here.

203
00:11:31,070 --> 00:11:31,710
It is.

204
00:11:32,190 --> 00:11:32,670
Take care.

205
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:33,500
It's settled.

206
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:34,560
I won't see you out.

207
00:11:41,310 --> 00:11:42,500
What do you mean?

208
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:44,500
It's the prey Master Liu has his eyes on.

209
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:45,550
Mr. Fan,

210
00:11:45,730 --> 00:11:46,970
a minute ago,

211
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:49,170
Mr. Yang closed this deal

212
00:11:49,190 --> 00:11:50,830
with me.

213
00:11:52,790 --> 00:11:55,720
You dared to poach clients
from your own peers?

214
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:57,390
You are mistaken, Mr. Fan.

215
00:11:57,620 --> 00:11:58,860
Nowadays,

216
00:11:58,890 --> 00:12:00,430
we believe in fair competition.

217
00:12:00,430 --> 00:12:01,500
You asked for too much

218
00:12:01,500 --> 00:12:02,670
and scared the client away.

219
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:03,700
Who can you blame for that?

220
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:05,550
Besides, the decision lies with the buyer,

221
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:06,980
not the seller.

222
00:12:07,550 --> 00:12:10,080
Don't you even understand
this simple logic?

223
00:12:24,030 --> 00:12:24,910
Master.

224
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:28,340
Shangguan Chengming definitely
knows that Yang guy.

225
00:12:28,460 --> 00:12:29,990
He has a guilty conscience.

226
00:12:31,710 --> 00:12:33,350
Those 2 little foxes

227
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:35,700
dared to play tricks on me.

228
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:39,100
Wait until they show their true colors.

229
00:12:39,670 --> 00:12:40,550
Understood.

230
00:12:43,390 --> 00:12:44,180
Mom,

231
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,720
keep this money.

232
00:12:46,390 --> 00:12:48,150
Your chronic chest pain

233
00:12:48,390 --> 00:12:49,950
flares up easily in cold weather.

234
00:12:49,950 --> 00:12:51,580
I have asked Manager Liu at the pharmacy

235
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:53,100
to have the medicine boiled

236
00:12:53,100 --> 00:12:54,500
and brought to you every week from now on.

237
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,820
You must remember to take
your medicine on time.

238
00:12:56,820 --> 00:12:58,220
Put aside the tailor shop work

239
00:12:58,220 --> 00:12:59,790
for now.

240
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:01,270
Don't take on night work, either.

241
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,790
From now on, I'll send the money over

242
00:13:02,790 --> 00:13:04,670
at the end of every month.

243
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,950
Once I'm settled down there,

244
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:09,430
I'll bring you over.

245
00:13:11,310 --> 00:13:12,950
You're getting older,

246
00:13:13,820 --> 00:13:16,020
yet I can't be by your side
to take care of you.

247
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:17,750
Ms. He was such a great actress.

248
00:13:18,310 --> 00:13:20,840
How did she end up
with a jerk like Tang Yushan?

249
00:13:21,270 --> 00:13:22,910
Can also make something of yourself.

250
00:13:22,910 --> 00:13:24,670
You're her fan, aren't you?

251
00:13:24,700 --> 00:13:27,750
Want to get justice for your idol?

252
00:13:28,590 --> 00:13:32,380
I just hope you live well.

253
00:13:33,340 --> 00:13:35,620
You must stay well.

254
00:13:37,190 --> 00:13:38,030
Mom,

255
00:13:39,070 --> 00:13:40,330
take care of yourself.

256
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,990
Tang Yushan used to be a punk.

257
00:13:49,910 --> 00:13:51,980
After latching onto Ms. He,

258
00:13:52,310 --> 00:13:54,100
he suddenly became a producer.

259
00:13:54,390 --> 00:13:56,220
Now that Ms. He is gone,

260
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:58,180
he still wants to exploit her

261
00:13:58,490 --> 00:14:00,860
by publishing a book.

262
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:02,500
Didn't I tell you

263
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:04,130
to mind your own business?

264
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,070
It's not good for you

265
00:14:06,070 --> 00:14:07,340
to offend someone like him.

266
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:08,720
But I can't just

267
00:14:08,910 --> 00:14:11,570
stand by and watch him
profit off her suffering.

268
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:15,340
Do you really have to do this?

269
00:14:17,630 --> 00:14:19,160
Yang Xiaozhong came to me.

270
00:14:19,340 --> 00:14:20,860
He attended our wedding.

271
00:14:21,070 --> 00:14:23,130
I was afraid that if I didn't help him,

272
00:14:23,390 --> 00:14:25,050
my identity would be exposed.

273
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:27,190
If you had wanted to silence him,

274
00:14:27,190 --> 00:14:28,550
you should have just killed him.

275
00:14:28,550 --> 00:14:29,510
I'm not joking with you.

276
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:31,720
Do I look like I'm joking?

277
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:33,910
Yang Xiaozhong has seen you and me.

278
00:14:33,910 --> 00:14:35,100
Have you ever thought about

279
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:37,670
what will happen if the sect finds out?

280
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:39,010
What if Sect Master

281
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:40,430
finds out?

282
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:47,230
Don't you think Ms. He is pitiful?

283
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:51,960
There are plenty of pitiful people

284
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:53,550
in this world.

285
00:14:54,150 --> 00:14:55,670
Are you going to save them all?

286
00:14:55,670 --> 00:14:58,820
We can barely save ourselves.

287
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:01,390
Master Swindler
is still keeping an eye on you.

288
00:15:01,390 --> 00:15:03,130
If something really happens to you,

289
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:04,130
who will save you?

290
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:05,270
I know the rules.

291
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:07,690
Hiring the Fifth Batou costs money.

292
00:15:08,990 --> 00:15:11,540
I have 2 gold bars
in my pocket right now.

293
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:13,220
My fee for running a con

294
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:15,340
has always been 3 gold bars.

295
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,820
I'll go borrow one right now.

296
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:19,150
I won't owe you.

297
00:15:20,070 --> 00:15:21,190
Come back to me

298
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:22,830
when you have enough money.

299
00:16:17,490 --> 00:16:19,370
Why have you been following me?

300
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:23,510
Manzhi,

301
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:26,780
I finally found you.

302
00:16:40,950 --> 00:16:41,990
Bro,

303
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,200
won't we get karma

304
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,130
for doing this?

305
00:16:47,950 --> 00:16:49,150
A kind word moves a man;

306
00:16:49,150 --> 00:16:50,550
a single incense offering moves a ghost.

307
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:52,320
If Ms. He's spirit is in heaven,

308
00:16:53,010 --> 00:16:54,340
she will understand us.

309
00:16:55,070 --> 00:16:56,030
True.

310
00:16:58,790 --> 00:16:59,390
Wait.

311
00:16:59,390 --> 00:17:01,220
Did you light the incense
before opening the coffin?

312
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:02,000
I did.

313
00:17:06,130 --> 00:17:07,609
Fill in a bit more here.

314
00:17:07,950 --> 00:17:08,670
Here.

315
00:17:24,069 --> 00:17:25,940
Fifth Batou, why are you here?

316
00:17:27,060 --> 00:17:28,740
It's useless for you to do this.

317
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:30,340
You know what I'm going to do?

318
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:31,940
People like Tang Yushan

319
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:33,940
don't buy this at all.

320
00:17:54,430 --> 00:17:55,430
Speak.

321
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,220
Hello?

322
00:18:16,910 --> 00:18:17,630
Mr. Tang,

323
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:18,440
it's Zhong.

324
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:19,430
Speak.

325
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:22,060
Something terrible happened.

326
00:18:22,060 --> 00:18:22,950
Manzhi...

327
00:18:23,300 --> 00:18:24,190
He Manzhi...

328
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:26,300
I saw her.

329
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:30,140
If you're possessed,

330
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:32,380
go pray at a temple, okay?

331
00:18:33,190 --> 00:18:34,780
Don't call me.

332
00:18:35,060 --> 00:18:36,020
No,

333
00:18:36,050 --> 00:18:37,950
there was a rainstorm yesterday, right?

334
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:40,430
I think I saw her ghost.

335
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:42,780
I felt uneasy after waking up today,

336
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:45,060
so I went to the cemetery to check.

337
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:46,300
The thunder yesterday

338
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:48,430
broke the tomb.

339
00:18:48,870 --> 00:18:50,530
The tomb was completely open,

340
00:18:50,590 --> 00:18:52,120
and the coffin was exposed.

341
00:18:52,190 --> 00:18:53,520
The coffin was exposed?

342
00:18:54,350 --> 00:18:55,540
You saw it with your own eyes?

343
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:57,740
The coffin was full of hair,

344
00:18:58,190 --> 00:18:59,540
jet-black hair.

345
00:18:59,540 --> 00:19:01,430
Mr. Tang, she has a grievance.

346
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:03,950
Then please

347
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:06,800
put her coffin back in the grave.

348
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:08,660
Then seal the tomb shut.

349
00:19:09,390 --> 00:19:10,910
While you're at it,

350
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:13,500
send a bouquet of flowers
to Manzhi for me.

351
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:14,350
Tell her

352
00:19:14,870 --> 00:19:16,350
I will always love her,

353
00:19:17,910 --> 00:19:18,740
always.

354
00:19:23,150 --> 00:19:24,010
It didn't work.

355
00:19:25,030 --> 00:19:26,420
I said all that,

356
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:29,240
but he still wouldn't go to her grave
to take a look.

357
00:19:29,870 --> 00:19:31,220
What did I say?

358
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:32,500
A jerk like him

359
00:19:32,630 --> 00:19:34,190
has no sense of shame.

360
00:19:34,460 --> 00:19:36,110
He doesn't revere ghosts or gods.

361
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:37,710
He only cares about himself.

362
00:19:40,870 --> 00:19:42,070
Not afraid of ghosts?

363
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:45,990
That's because he hasn't seen one.

364
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:55,430
Lin Xiangyu,

365
00:19:55,540 --> 00:19:56,740
stop messing around.

366
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:58,740
I won't sign

367
00:19:59,590 --> 00:20:00,540
such an unreasonable agreement.

368
00:20:00,540 --> 00:20:03,060
Don't forget who made you famous!

369
00:20:04,630 --> 00:20:06,460
I've had a hard life since I was a kid.

370
00:20:06,460 --> 00:20:07,060
Mr. Tang,

371
00:20:07,430 --> 00:20:09,890
I've read the first half
of your manuscript.

372
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:12,450
It's absolutely brilliant.

373
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:15,260
But for the second half, could you give us

374
00:20:15,860 --> 00:20:17,520
something more sensational?

375
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:20,670
Chief Editor Zheng,

376
00:20:21,190 --> 00:20:21,980
I'm sorry.

377
00:20:23,020 --> 00:20:24,670
I really don't know how to keep writing.

378
00:20:24,670 --> 00:20:26,300
Because whenever I pick up my pen,

379
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:27,300
I think of her.

380
00:20:27,300 --> 00:20:28,590
I think of her the moment
I pick up my pen.

381
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:30,020
Plus, the recent royalty issues

382
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:31,590
are driving me crazy.

383
00:20:31,590 --> 00:20:33,670
I just can't write anymore. I'm sorry.

384
00:20:33,670 --> 00:20:34,910
Mr. Tang.

385
00:20:36,590 --> 00:20:37,980
Regarding the publishing rights,

386
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:40,540
we are willing to pay 50%

387
00:20:41,430 --> 00:20:42,760
above the market price.

388
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:48,220
50%?

389
00:20:51,590 --> 00:20:52,720
Chief Editor Zheng,

390
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:54,980
please take back what you just said, okay?

391
00:20:54,980 --> 00:20:56,190
Fuxiang Publishing House offered

392
00:20:56,190 --> 00:20:57,740
twice what you're paying.

393
00:20:57,740 --> 00:20:59,260
Do you know why I turned them down?

394
00:20:59,260 --> 00:21:02,100
The Story of My Past with He Manzhi.

395
00:21:02,130 --> 00:21:03,630
What price can be put on these words?

396
00:21:03,630 --> 00:21:05,260
Can this ever be measured in money?

397
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:06,700
I think the quote is just a formality.

398
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:07,740
It represents

399
00:21:09,060 --> 00:21:10,460
respect for Manzhi.

400
00:21:10,460 --> 00:21:11,430
Please say no more.

401
00:21:11,430 --> 00:21:13,060
I feel this is an insult to art,

402
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:13,740
an insult to me,

403
00:21:13,740 --> 00:21:15,590
and an insult to my wife, okay?

404
00:21:15,590 --> 00:21:16,200
Mr. Tang,

405
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:18,680
I will absolutely show
my utmost sincerity.

406
00:21:18,950 --> 00:21:19,700
It's just that

407
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:22,360
I need to discuss this
with our president again.

408
00:21:22,370 --> 00:21:23,180
Easy.

409
00:21:32,380 --> 00:21:33,260
My friend.

410
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:35,540
You are still young.

411
00:21:35,650 --> 00:21:38,380
There are some things
you don't see clearly.

412
00:21:39,350 --> 00:21:40,880
Have you ever thought about

413
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:43,480
how much wealth it could create

414
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:46,700
if you convince the president

415
00:21:46,730 --> 00:21:47,950
to buy up the rights
to this sure-to-become-hit novel—

416
00:21:47,950 --> 00:21:50,780
the film production rights,

417
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:52,700
and even the sequel film rights,

418
00:21:52,700 --> 00:21:53,780
all bundled together,

419
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:56,260
at a very reasonable price?

420
00:21:56,260 --> 00:21:57,590
And if this succeeds,

421
00:21:57,780 --> 00:21:58,780
do you think

422
00:21:59,110 --> 00:22:01,150
I'd forget my friends?

423
00:22:21,630 --> 00:22:22,360
What is this?

424
00:22:23,690 --> 00:22:25,650
Can you guys do anything right?

425
00:22:29,420 --> 00:22:31,700
I will pay you back every single penny.

426
00:22:32,350 --> 00:22:33,830
But you won't take away

427
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:37,300
even a shred of my dignity.

428
00:23:09,260 --> 00:23:10,110
Who is it?

429
00:23:11,190 --> 00:23:12,390
Stop messing around.

430
00:23:17,990 --> 00:23:20,090
♪ Night rain taps the window,
dampening the silk canopy ♪

431
00:23:20,370 --> 00:23:23,340
♪ The face in the mirror
still wears its old look ♪

432
00:23:23,780 --> 00:23:28,080
♪ I trace an eyebrow
to hide the tear in my eye ♪

433
00:23:29,650 --> 00:23:30,590
Who's there?

434
00:23:29,690 --> 00:23:35,350
♪ My love, tell me if I'm cold
or burning hot ♪

435
00:23:35,740 --> 00:23:37,110
I see you!

436
00:23:35,970 --> 00:23:40,600
♪ Rouge is as red as blood plasma ♪

437
00:23:41,610 --> 00:23:46,340
♪ Stained on lips,
yet sealed deep in your heart ♪

438
00:23:47,340 --> 00:23:52,100
♪ This red thread loops round my neck ♪

439
00:23:53,050 --> 00:23:57,600
♪ It tightens more; even broken,
our bond endures ♪

440
00:23:58,770 --> 00:24:01,590
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

441
00:24:02,100 --> 00:24:04,850
♪ We're a pair in this life ♪

442
00:24:05,170 --> 00:24:07,670
♪ Lying in one bed;
sharing one coffin when dead ♪

443
00:24:07,740 --> 00:24:12,590
♪ Turn to ash and dust,
mixed as one instead ♪

444
00:24:14,380 --> 00:24:16,600
♪ Don't look back or panic ♪

445
00:24:17,490 --> 00:24:19,850
♪ Right here, by your side ♪

446
00:24:20,300 --> 00:24:22,510
♪ Press to your back
and breathe your scent ♪

447
00:24:21,380 --> 00:24:22,500
Won't sleep, huh?

448
00:24:23,120 --> 00:24:27,500
♪ With cold long nails,
I loose your robe ♪

449
00:24:23,220 --> 00:24:24,350
Wanna die?

450
00:24:24,460 --> 00:24:25,260
Close it!

451
00:24:27,630 --> 00:24:28,670
I said close...

452
00:24:28,700 --> 00:24:31,370
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

453
00:24:32,220 --> 00:24:34,590
♪ Through every life,
we remain as a pair ♪

454
00:24:35,330 --> 00:24:37,850
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

455
00:24:38,280 --> 00:24:45,260
♪ I must speak to you
about this bitter grudge ♪

456
00:25:15,230 --> 00:25:17,290
[Die]

457
00:25:59,550 --> 00:26:02,140
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

458
00:26:02,470 --> 00:26:05,300
♪ We're a pair in this life ♪

459
00:26:05,430 --> 00:26:08,060
♪ Lying in one bed;
sharing one coffin when dead ♪

460
00:26:08,280 --> 00:26:12,550
♪ Turn to ash and dust,
mixed as one instead ♪

461
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:16,990
♪ Don't look back or panic ♪

462
00:26:17,790 --> 00:26:20,210
♪ Right here, by your side ♪

463
00:26:20,360 --> 00:26:22,960
♪ Press to your back
and breathe your scent ♪

464
00:26:23,660 --> 00:26:27,960
♪ With cold long nails,
I loose your robe ♪

465
00:26:29,180 --> 00:26:31,950
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

466
00:26:32,510 --> 00:26:34,960
♪ Through every life,
we remain as a pair ♪

467
00:26:35,570 --> 00:26:38,210
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

468
00:26:38,410 --> 00:26:41,960
♪ I must speak to you
about this bitter grudge ♪

469
00:26:54,060 --> 00:26:56,700
Yushan.

470
00:26:57,310 --> 00:26:59,660
Don't you miss me?

471
00:27:02,740 --> 00:27:04,700
Then why did you

472
00:27:05,840 --> 00:27:07,760
want to kill me?

473
00:27:25,210 --> 00:27:26,930
So easily frightened.

474
00:28:05,950 --> 00:28:06,950
Thank you,

475
00:28:07,690 --> 00:28:11,060
♪ Rouge is as red as blood plasma ♪

476
00:28:07,950 --> 00:28:08,910
Fourth Batou.

477
00:28:11,750 --> 00:28:16,240
♪ Stained on lips,
yet sealed deep in your heart ♪

478
00:28:17,480 --> 00:28:22,300
♪ This red thread loops round my neck ♪

479
00:28:21,260 --> 00:28:23,300
I heard you never set traps.

480
00:28:23,700 --> 00:28:27,720
♪ It tightens more; even broken,
our bond endures ♪

481
00:28:23,980 --> 00:28:25,300
Why help me?

482
00:28:25,350 --> 00:28:27,110
Who said I never set traps?

483
00:28:28,220 --> 00:28:30,630
Who wouldn't want to enforce justice
on behalf of Heaven?

484
00:28:29,570 --> 00:28:31,810
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

485
00:28:31,390 --> 00:28:33,390
That's also why Sect Master

486
00:28:32,550 --> 00:28:40,310
♪ I must speak to you
about this bitter grudge ♪

487
00:28:33,460 --> 00:28:35,720
let me join the Tianxiang Sect back then.

488
00:28:37,390 --> 00:28:38,740
You're quite naive.

489
00:28:39,590 --> 00:28:41,500
You joined the Tianxiang Sect

490
00:28:41,900 --> 00:28:43,300
just to enforce justice.

491
00:28:45,260 --> 00:28:46,260
For so many years,

492
00:28:48,020 --> 00:28:51,220
all the people in the sect
have thought about is how to harm others

493
00:28:51,220 --> 00:28:52,550
and swindle money.

494
00:28:55,150 --> 00:28:56,750
You are different from them.

495
00:29:35,950 --> 00:29:36,980
Get closer.

496
00:29:40,280 --> 00:29:41,760
Closer.

497
00:29:48,700 --> 00:29:49,740
Master Chang.

498
00:29:51,980 --> 00:29:53,610
I'm good here.

499
00:29:53,630 --> 00:29:55,390
If you're too far,

500
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:58,050
the victim won't feel it.

501
00:30:16,890 --> 00:30:19,680
When I opened the coffin
for the autopsy just now,

502
00:30:19,700 --> 00:30:22,630
I noticed signs
of a zombie transformation.

503
00:30:23,190 --> 00:30:24,220
But don't be afraid.

504
00:30:24,220 --> 00:30:25,740
I've set up a formation.

505
00:30:25,910 --> 00:30:26,700
It's safe.

506
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:28,390
Once I perform a ritual,

507
00:30:28,420 --> 00:30:30,640
you can rest easy.

508
00:30:31,540 --> 00:30:35,190
The victim's resentment should dissipate.

509
00:30:50,630 --> 00:30:56,380
♪ He Manzhi bears unjust grief ♪

510
00:30:54,700 --> 00:30:55,260
Master!

511
00:30:55,870 --> 00:30:56,660
Master!

512
00:30:56,730 --> 00:30:59,880
♪ Wed Tang Yushan by wrong fate ♪

513
00:31:00,250 --> 00:31:03,130
♪ Tang Yushan, a wolfish spouse ♪

514
00:31:03,700 --> 00:31:05,850
♪ Took her life and severed all kin ties ♪

515
00:31:05,020 --> 00:31:07,150
I can't do this job!

516
00:31:06,560 --> 00:31:09,350
♪ Yin and mortal realms hold this trial ♪

517
00:31:07,150 --> 00:31:08,430
My cultivation isn't strong enough

518
00:31:08,430 --> 00:31:09,500
to suppress it!

519
00:31:09,500 --> 00:31:11,190
But you have to save me.

520
00:31:09,600 --> 00:31:15,850
♪ My husband Tang Yushan is a beast ♪

521
00:31:11,190 --> 00:31:11,780
You have to save me.

522
00:31:11,780 --> 00:31:14,670
How about I invite my mentor

523
00:31:14,670 --> 00:31:15,460
to take a look?

524
00:31:15,460 --> 00:31:17,460
Go invite him right now.

525
00:31:16,350 --> 00:31:20,600
♪ He stole my life away ♪

526
00:31:17,460 --> 00:31:19,740
Okay.

527
00:31:19,740 --> 00:31:21,300
Let's go.

528
00:31:20,620 --> 00:31:27,260
♪ Redress He Manzhi's unjust wrongs ♪

529
00:31:37,220 --> 00:31:39,020
Mr. Tang, please be patient.

530
00:31:39,020 --> 00:31:41,080
My mentor will definitely have a way.

531
00:31:45,630 --> 00:31:47,110
Performing this ritual

532
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:50,680
will probably exhaust all my cultivation.

533
00:31:51,540 --> 00:31:53,110
Mentor, if it consumes so much
of your cultivation,

534
00:31:53,110 --> 00:31:54,910
we might as well not do this ritual.

535
00:31:54,910 --> 00:31:55,640
Please, no!

536
00:31:55,910 --> 00:31:56,500
Mentor.

537
00:31:56,500 --> 00:31:57,010
No.

538
00:31:57,220 --> 00:31:57,980
Master.

539
00:31:58,030 --> 00:31:59,460
I heard you were coming.

540
00:31:59,480 --> 00:32:00,510
Look, I've spent my money

541
00:32:00,510 --> 00:32:02,560
setting up the formation again.

542
00:32:02,590 --> 00:32:04,020
You have to do this.

543
00:32:04,700 --> 00:32:06,300
Money is not an issue.

544
00:32:06,300 --> 00:32:07,430
You must help me.

545
00:32:08,220 --> 00:32:10,880
The sage puts himself last
and rises to the fore;

546
00:32:11,150 --> 00:32:13,150
he sets himself aside,
and his life endures.

547
00:32:13,150 --> 00:32:15,410
It means putting others before oneself.

548
00:32:16,910 --> 00:32:18,990
I'll help you with this.

549
00:33:08,020 --> 00:33:08,630
Break!

550
00:33:27,950 --> 00:33:28,870
Break the ground.

551
00:33:28,870 --> 00:33:29,800
Open the coffin.

552
00:33:45,520 --> 00:33:46,190
Master.

553
00:33:48,980 --> 00:33:49,700
Hair.

554
00:33:50,500 --> 00:33:51,280
Hair.

555
00:33:51,310 --> 00:33:52,830
Just as I expected.

556
00:33:53,540 --> 00:33:56,110
Ms. He's resentment
has turned into pus and blood.

557
00:33:56,110 --> 00:33:58,350
Soon, it will gather into a soul

558
00:33:58,550 --> 00:33:59,690
and become a vengeful spirit.

559
00:33:59,690 --> 00:34:02,410
Mr. Tang, you found me just in time.

560
00:34:02,830 --> 00:34:03,830
But

561
00:34:04,350 --> 00:34:06,300
I'll need you for the next step.

562
00:34:07,460 --> 00:34:08,460
Me?

563
00:34:35,820 --> 00:34:37,929
You can't leave, Mr. Tang!

564
00:34:39,020 --> 00:34:40,870
Only a close relative

565
00:34:40,870 --> 00:34:42,870
can bring Ms. He's soul back to her body.

566
00:34:42,870 --> 00:34:43,659
Mr. Tang,

567
00:34:43,980 --> 00:34:45,580
go hold her hand now.

568
00:34:45,580 --> 00:34:48,179
No matter what happens, don't let go.

569
00:34:48,179 --> 00:34:49,460
I can't hold it!

570
00:34:49,489 --> 00:34:51,510
Mr. Tang, we can't give up halfway!

571
00:34:51,530 --> 00:34:52,420
Mr. Tang!

572
00:34:52,540 --> 00:34:53,429
Mr. Tang!

573
00:34:56,989 --> 00:34:58,110
Yushan.

574
00:34:58,500 --> 00:35:00,390
Help!

575
00:35:01,750 --> 00:35:03,460
Ms. He's soul has returned.

576
00:35:03,750 --> 00:35:06,540
Mr. Tang, if you have anything
to say to her,

577
00:35:06,570 --> 00:35:08,130
say it now.

578
00:35:08,350 --> 00:35:10,580
I have nothing to say to her.

579
00:35:10,580 --> 00:35:12,500
What should I say?

580
00:35:12,500 --> 00:35:14,390
Say whatever will put her at ease.

581
00:35:14,950 --> 00:35:17,540
But remember, you must tell the truth.

582
00:35:21,790 --> 00:35:23,710
Manzhi.

583
00:35:23,830 --> 00:35:25,540
Stop thinking about me.

584
00:35:26,020 --> 00:35:27,910
I'm doing fine here.

585
00:35:27,910 --> 00:35:29,020
Hurry up and reincarnate.

586
00:35:29,020 --> 00:35:31,680
Let's be husband and wife again
in the next life!

587
00:35:33,310 --> 00:35:34,910
Why did you kill me?

588
00:35:35,390 --> 00:35:36,270
Why?

589
00:35:36,270 --> 00:35:38,710
I...

590
00:35:39,100 --> 00:35:40,180
I...

591
00:35:40,180 --> 00:35:42,660
I told you to tell the truth.

592
00:35:43,130 --> 00:35:44,720
Is there something else you haven't said?

593
00:35:44,720 --> 00:35:46,880
Nothing.

594
00:35:47,100 --> 00:35:48,350
Tang Yushan,

595
00:35:48,580 --> 00:35:49,710
tell me now.

596
00:35:50,230 --> 00:35:52,620
Why on earth did you kill me?

597
00:35:52,830 --> 00:35:55,310
I'll tell you.

598
00:36:00,060 --> 00:36:01,430
Master.

599
00:36:01,580 --> 00:36:05,270
Let us have a private talk.

600
00:36:05,390 --> 00:36:07,310
Give me some space, okay?

601
00:36:08,190 --> 00:36:08,900
Mentor.

602
00:36:15,230 --> 00:36:16,120
Don't go too far!

603
00:36:16,120 --> 00:36:17,310
Don't go too far!

604
00:36:17,570 --> 00:36:18,370
Don't worry.

605
00:36:22,950 --> 00:36:24,580
Don't go any further!

606
00:36:24,610 --> 00:36:25,880
You two just stay there!

607
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:26,740
Right there!

608
00:36:26,850 --> 00:36:27,910
Go ahead and speak!

609
00:36:30,390 --> 00:36:31,350
Manzhi,

610
00:36:31,460 --> 00:36:32,950
I'm sorry.

611
00:36:33,140 --> 00:36:34,980
I didn't mean it back then.

612
00:36:38,310 --> 00:36:39,830
Reincarnate well.

613
00:36:40,180 --> 00:36:41,430
I'll repay you...

614
00:36:41,580 --> 00:36:43,140
in my next life.

615
00:36:43,310 --> 00:36:44,980
I'll be your beast of burden

616
00:36:45,350 --> 00:36:49,430
in my next life. Please let me go.

617
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:58,000
What are these people doing?

618
00:36:58,100 --> 00:36:59,760
They don't seem to be our guys.

619
00:37:01,170 --> 00:37:02,570
Where is Yang Xiaozhong?

620
00:37:02,660 --> 00:37:03,100
Him?

621
00:37:03,540 --> 00:37:06,230
Yang Xiaozhong always talked about
exposing this animal.

622
00:37:06,230 --> 00:37:08,210
Do you think he arranged for these people?

623
00:37:08,210 --> 00:37:09,080
Oh no.

624
00:37:14,820 --> 00:37:16,550
Are you even human?

625
00:37:16,700 --> 00:37:18,450
Do you have any humanity?

626
00:37:20,100 --> 00:37:22,060
You wouldn't let He Manzhi go

627
00:37:22,140 --> 00:37:23,780
when she was alive!

628
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:27,530
Now that she's dead, you still won't let
her rest in peace, will you?

629
00:37:27,740 --> 00:37:28,490
Fine then.

630
00:37:28,860 --> 00:37:30,270
Don't you want to take pictures?

631
00:37:30,270 --> 00:37:30,950
Come on!

632
00:37:31,710 --> 00:37:32,620
Take pictures of me!

633
00:37:32,620 --> 00:37:33,500
Come on!

634
00:37:34,020 --> 00:37:35,750
Take all the pictures you want!

635
00:37:35,990 --> 00:37:38,070
Take all the pictures you want!

636
00:37:41,140 --> 00:37:43,020
Manzhi!

637
00:37:44,620 --> 00:37:47,180
I'm so sorry for you!

638
00:37:47,430 --> 00:37:49,180
I didn't give you a good life

639
00:37:49,210 --> 00:37:51,690
when you were alive.

640
00:37:51,740 --> 00:37:54,800
And I can't even let you rest in peace
after you're dead,

641
00:37:54,820 --> 00:37:56,570
Manzhi!

642
00:38:01,240 --> 00:38:03,060
Mr. Tang, there's no need for this.

643
00:38:03,060 --> 00:38:04,310
I hear you've recently

644
00:38:04,310 --> 00:38:06,460
been writing a biography of Ms. He.

645
00:38:06,660 --> 00:38:08,060
Ms. He's fans have been

646
00:38:08,060 --> 00:38:09,660
watching this book closely.

647
00:38:09,750 --> 00:38:11,430
When do you plan to publish it?

648
00:38:11,430 --> 00:38:12,660
Rumor has it that due to gambling,

649
00:38:12,660 --> 00:38:14,230
your financial situation has been poor.

650
00:38:14,230 --> 00:38:15,270
Are you facing great difficulties

651
00:38:15,270 --> 00:38:16,800
with the publishing funds?

652
00:38:19,620 --> 00:38:21,310
I don't care

653
00:38:21,540 --> 00:38:22,940
if everyone slanders me.

654
00:38:23,390 --> 00:38:24,270
But

655
00:38:24,790 --> 00:38:26,390
all of you, remember this.

656
00:38:26,660 --> 00:38:27,870
I will definitely

657
00:38:28,790 --> 00:38:30,230
publish this book.

658
00:38:30,260 --> 00:38:32,180
I'll publish it

659
00:38:32,200 --> 00:38:34,150
even if I have to sell

660
00:38:34,230 --> 00:38:36,270
everything I own!

661
00:38:36,270 --> 00:38:38,790
There are so many things in this book

662
00:38:38,790 --> 00:38:41,100
that I want to say to Manzhi.

663
00:38:41,790 --> 00:38:43,830
She can't hear them anymore.

664
00:38:43,830 --> 00:38:46,140
Do you have any thoughts
of adapting it into a movie?

665
00:38:46,140 --> 00:38:47,350
Of course, I do!

666
00:38:48,710 --> 00:38:49,950
Listen up!

667
00:38:49,950 --> 00:38:52,790
Not only will I adapt
this book into a movie,

668
00:38:52,790 --> 00:38:54,270
but I'll also make the movie

669
00:38:54,270 --> 00:38:55,020
become

670
00:38:55,020 --> 00:38:57,660
a milestone in Chinese film history!

671
00:38:58,100 --> 00:38:59,270
He Manzhi,

672
00:38:59,580 --> 00:39:00,710
I love you!

673
00:39:00,910 --> 00:39:03,980
I will definitely make this movie well

674
00:39:04,180 --> 00:39:05,950
and finish it for you!

675
00:39:06,140 --> 00:39:08,430
Yang Xiaozhong meant well
but did a bad thing,

676
00:39:08,430 --> 00:39:10,090
paving the way for this beast.

677
00:39:12,180 --> 00:39:12,950
Here is...

678
00:39:14,430 --> 00:39:15,980
the gold bar I owed you.

679
00:39:19,460 --> 00:39:20,310
You gave up?

680
00:39:22,390 --> 00:39:24,790
I couldn't just beat
that bastard to death.

681
00:39:26,660 --> 00:39:27,990
I saw He Manzhi's mother

682
00:39:28,660 --> 00:39:30,060
after the movie that day.

683
00:39:31,430 --> 00:39:32,830
She was delirious

684
00:39:34,020 --> 00:39:35,620
and mistook me for He Manzhi.

685
00:39:37,020 --> 00:39:38,950
The old lady still doesn't believe

686
00:39:39,660 --> 00:39:40,950
her daughter is dead.

687
00:39:42,540 --> 00:39:43,430
Tell me,

688
00:39:44,660 --> 00:39:46,390
is it worth it

689
00:39:48,350 --> 00:39:50,210
to seek justice for a dead person?

690
00:39:58,790 --> 00:39:59,910
Maybe...

691
00:40:02,950 --> 00:40:04,910
for some of the living,

692
00:40:06,710 --> 00:40:08,660
it's the only thing worth doing.

693
00:40:16,570 --> 00:40:19,930
These 3 gold bars
are the payment you gave me.

694
00:40:20,310 --> 00:40:21,230
We're even.

695
00:40:22,950 --> 00:40:23,910
Now,

696
00:40:24,580 --> 00:40:25,830
I'm giving them to you

697
00:40:26,710 --> 00:40:28,110
to hire you to work for me.

698
00:40:29,790 --> 00:40:30,580
I'll take

699
00:40:32,460 --> 00:40:33,350
this deal.

700
00:40:42,600 --> 00:40:44,860
[In the next episode]

701
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:46,420
Are you filming a movie?

702
00:40:46,500 --> 00:40:47,980
Who should I act with?

703
00:40:48,120 --> 00:40:49,330
He Manzhi.

704
00:40:49,390 --> 00:40:50,110
He Man...

705
00:40:50,390 --> 00:40:51,600
He Manzhi?

706
00:40:53,620 --> 00:40:54,580
Okay.

707
00:40:54,890 --> 00:40:56,500
Attention, all departments.

708
00:40:56,500 --> 00:40:57,230
Rolling.

709
00:40:57,230 --> 00:40:57,910
Ah.

710
00:40:58,230 --> 00:41:01,250
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

711
00:41:01,660 --> 00:41:02,500
But...

712
00:41:02,500 --> 00:41:03,610
I'm sorry, Director.

713
00:41:03,610 --> 00:41:05,730
Do we have to film this movie?

714
00:41:05,910 --> 00:41:07,100
We must do it.

715
00:41:07,100 --> 00:41:09,100
I want everyone to witness

716
00:41:09,130 --> 00:41:11,130
He Manzhi's return.

717
00:41:11,540 --> 00:41:13,230
I'll make this movie...

718
00:41:13,230 --> 00:41:15,180
You want me to summon souls?

719
00:41:15,500 --> 00:41:16,830
A smash hit.

720
00:41:17,060 --> 00:41:18,100
Necklace.

721
00:41:18,270 --> 00:41:19,070
Soul seizure.

722
00:41:19,620 --> 00:41:21,280
Once she wears that necklace,

723
00:41:21,310 --> 00:41:22,430
Manyu

724
00:41:22,640 --> 00:41:22,980
will be possessed.

725
00:41:22,980 --> 00:41:24,310
But I know

726
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:27,030
this is not me.
